**Isolating and committing only relevant run changes**

The agent identifies many unrelated modified or untracked files from earlier runs and concludes it must only commit changes made during this run, including new logs and source edits, while avoiding unrelated or pre-existing modifications.
thinking
**Reconciling staging all changes with excluding unrelated files**

The agent notes a conflict between task instructions to stage all changes unconditionally and the risk of committing large or unrelated untracked files. To resolve this, it plans to inspect diffs on suspect files to determine which modifications originated from this run before committing.
